  "bodyHash": "90d8d39616c513d2",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/N87a3Q8.png\" width=\"420\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&logo=condaforge&logoColor=d9aa6b&labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-Upgraded Core-F16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=FFFFFF&labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"239\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.20.x-Active Development-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">请使用 CurseForge 下载，请勿重新托管文件。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组可用于任何整合包。（在 CurseForge 上）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;目前暂无 Fabric 版本计划，抱歉。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">如需更多，请查看 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Upgraded Additional Trims</span></a></span></span><span style=\"color:#f00\">。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">描述</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">为所有镶边材料添加有用的效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">效果</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sFjod2T.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e3d4c4\">守护</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">10% 几率抵抗负面效果。（可叠加）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kw8qnd6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ececec\">防御者</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">减少受到的伤害 0.25。（可叠加）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yzaIHYY.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#625859;text-decoration:underline\">壁垒</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">减少受到的伤害 10%。（可叠加）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/c8AcQjp.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#971607;text-decoration:underline\">红步</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">增加冲刺速度 5%。（可叠加）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">踩踏时激活红石导线。（需要靴子）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/RjaMEIO.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#b4684d;text-decoration:underline\">导体</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">25% 几率引导闪电击中你。（可叠加）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">免疫闪电伤害。（需要全套装备）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/WBkJMTZ.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#deb12d;text-decoration:underline\">幸运</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">增加幸运值 1。（可叠加）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">使猪灵对你保持中立。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/93RJL6w.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#11a036\">演说</span><br>增加与村民的好感度 20%。（可叠加）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mr52ygA.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#6eecd2\">坚固</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">物品耐久度增加 50%。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（耐久度加成只能使用钻石或经验修补进行修复）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EAtx0hT.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#416e97\">闪耀</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">物品附魔能力增加 50%（最高 10）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#9a5cc6\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/uhBl5LG.png\" alt=\"\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">增幅</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">增加有益效果持续时间 10%。（可叠加）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的其他模组</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 +</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">旧版本</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VV3KsKX.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EHr3tPZ.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>",
